# MNLM PoC transient outputs.
# Persistent research evidence (training curves, evaluation JSONs, run reports,
# crawler audit log) is committed in docs/research/mnlm/poc_*/.
# Excluded: per-run scratch directories of Kadmos-emitted chunks, raw stdout
# logs, and smoke-test output. These can be regenerated from the source corpora
# (see docs/research/mnlm/poc_legacy/README.md for the Gen-1 rationale and
# docs/research/mnlm/poc_mesh/README.md for the post-MESH PoC).
